    <profile name="Psychic - Creeping Terror" id="b513ac41-1f57-fee1-6f8f-e8be75290a02" hidden="false" page="241" publicationId="ca4c-9142-pubN73886" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Malediction, Warp Charge 1, targets a single enemy unit within 12&quot;. The target unit has I1 and may only fire Snap Shots until the end of that unit&apos;s next turn. Units with Fearless are unaffected. Units with And They Shall Know No Fear, or Stubborn, may attempt an Ld test to ignore the effects if they pass.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Psychic - Gift of Contagion" id="0b9a8e86-3b8b-eb0f-a0b9-8d52529a8a28" hidden="false" page="71" publicationId="ca4c-9142-pubN90664" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Malediction, Warp Charge 1, affects a single enemy unit within 48&quot;. Roll D3 for the effect on every model in the unit whilst the power is in effect. Multiple effects are cumulative. 1: Flyblown Palsy: -1A and Shrouded. 2: Muscular Atrophy: -1S and may not Run. 3: Liquefying Ague: -1S and -1T.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Psychic - Nurgle&apos;s Rot" id="db02f73c-790e-4ba2-face-374feb4b7f99" hidden="false" page="71" publicationId="ca4c-9142-pubN90664" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
